    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0476_T05FS0101_gText_PleaseComeAgain",
      "en_US": "Please come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0476_T05FS0101_LavenderTown_Mart_Text_SearchingForStatRaiseItems",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m searching for items that raise\n",
        "the stats of Pokémon.\r",
        "They’re effective over the course\n",
        "of a single battle.\r",
        "X Attack, X Defend, X Speed, \n",
        "and X Special are what I’m after.\r",
        "Do you know where I can get them?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0476_T05FS0101_LavenderTown_Mart_Text_DidYouBuyRevives",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you buy some Revives?\n",
        "They revive any fainted Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0476_T05FS0101_LavenderTown_Mart_Text_TrainerDuosCanChallengeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Sometimes, a Trainer duo will\n",
        "challenge you with two Pokémon\f",
        "at the same time.\r",
        "If that happens, you have to send\n",
        "out two Pokémon to battle, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0476_T05FS0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
